<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES FIRM TO $3.665 BLN - SEPT 18.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK C.BANK RESERVES FIRM TO $3.665 BLN - SEPT 18.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of</p>
<p>Slovakia (NBS) on Monday said its hard currency reserves</p>
<p>firmed to $3.665 billion as of September 18, from $3.635</p>
<p>billion on September 11.</p>
<p> HARD CURRENCY RESERVES     Sept 18  Sept 11  Sept '95</p>
<p>  NBS reserves ($bln)	 3.665    3.635    2.825</p>
<p>  Commercial banks	    1.261    1.210    1.581</p>
<p>  Entire banking sector     4.925    4.845    4.406</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
